  "user_id": 18603,
  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "\r\n## AND Logic\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. Before checking both boxes, predict when the result will say **\"Access granted.\"**\r\n2. Then, toggle both checkboxes to test every combination. Notice which combination(s) make the result turn green.\r\n3. In your Activity Guide, complete all 4 rows of the AND (`&&`) truth table and write one sentence explaining what you observed about how the AND operator works.",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "preview",
    "ai_tutor_mode": "outline",
    "predict_settings": {
      "isPredictLevel": false,
      "solution": "",
      "questionType": "freeResponse",
      "allowMultipleAttempts": false,
      "placeholderText": "",
